  "title": "Bluesky Blocks Links to Leaked DHS Employee Data as Government Sought Takedowns",
  "summary": "A social media platform, Bluesky, is blocking access to a leaked archive of information related to Homeland Security staff, including contact details of agents and other employees. The government is investigating potential threats to national security and seeking measures to contain the breach.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "Bluesky blocked links to a leaked archive of information on 41,000 ICE, CBP, and other DHS workers because it contains people’s contact information, shared without their authorization.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The government is investigating potential threats to national security and seeking measures to contain the breach.",
      "confidence": 0.95
